{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Doctor Visit</strong> is a visual novel where you play as a doctor's patient. You have something mysterious growing on your hand. Your issue gets worse and worse as more days passes. Will the doctor help you or a much worse fate awaits you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choices you make will determine the ending of the story. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEMO GAME FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short branching narrative with player choices that affect the ending.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One ending exclusive to the demo (the full version contains all 8 endings).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric background art and scenes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subtle sound design and music to heighten the mystery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playtime: around 10\u201315 minutes for one complete demo run. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>DEMO version</strong> includes one ending, with a playtime around 25 minutes.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4144870?t=1762834759","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4144870?t=1762834759","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144870/a472ab37bc6b074c3c2e73c39854d21101cd7570/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762834759","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144870/a472ab37bc6b074c3c2e73c39854d21101cd7570/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762834759","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Doctor Visit</strong> is a visual novel where you play as a doctor's patient. You have something mysterious growing on your hand. Your issue gets worse an